[77.768091, "o", "+\"\"\"Read one station's raw daily file and turn it into the standard daily inputs used by ``fao56.et0_daily``.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[77.768159, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[77.76822, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[77.768269, "o", "> "]
[77.76895, "o", "+The raw files contain measurements in the units described in ``docs/METHOD.md``.  Two conversions are required\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[77.76904, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[77.769387, "o", "+before the data can be fed to the FAO‑56 equations:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[77.769454, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> +\r\n"]
[77.769508, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[77.769561, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[77.770308, "o", "+1. **Wind speed** – stations report mean wind speed at the height of their anemometer (``station.wind_height_m``).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[77.770379, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[77.770437, "o", "> "]
[77.77115, "o", "+   The FAO‑56 model expects wind speed at 2 m above the ground.  The conversion uses the logarithmic wind profile\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[77.771211, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[77.771374, "o", "+   (FAO‑56 Eq. 47):\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[77.771442, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[77.771501, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[77.771561, "o", "> "]
[77.771814, "o", "+   ``u2 = u * (4.87 / log(67.8 * z - 5.42))``\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[77.771872, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[77.771904, "o", "> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[77.77199, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[77.772547, "o", "+   where ``u`` is the measured wind speed and ``z`` is the anemometer height in metres.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[77.772624, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[77.772674, "o", "+\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[77.77274, "o", "> "]
[77.773544, "o", "+2. **Solar radiation** – raw radiation can be in MJ m⁻² day⁻¹ (already suitable) or in W m⁻².  When the unit is\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[77.773603, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[77.774378, "o", "+   ``W/m2`` we convert to MJ m⁻² day⁻¹ using ``MJ = W * 86400 / 1e6`` (seconds per day, 10⁶ J per MJ).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[77.774445, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[77.774492, "o", "+\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[77.774536, "o", "> "]
[77.775138, "o", "+These conversions are applied after the raw CSV is read and before the DataFrame is returned.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[77.77518, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[77.775229, "o", "> +\"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[77.775271, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[77.775313, "o", "+\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[77.775356, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
