[103.025518, "o", "ation register\r\n+    df[\"rs\"] = _convert_radiation(raw[\"solar_rad\"].astype(float), stat"]
[103.025537, "o", "ion.radiation_units)\r\n+    return df\r\n+\r\n+EOF\r\n"]
[103.025564, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.025587, "o", "> "]
[103.025864, "o", "\"\"\"Read one station's raw daily file and turn it into the standard daily inputs used by ``fao56.et0_daily``.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.025885, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.025899, "o", "> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.025928, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.026232, "o", "+The raw files contain measurements in the units described in ``docs/METHOD.md``. Two conversions are required\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.026256, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.026407, "o", "+before the data can be fed to the FAO‑56 equations:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.026436, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.02646, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.026483, "o", "> "]
[103.026785, "o", "+1. **Wind speed** – stations report mean wind speed at the height of their anemometer (``station.wind_height_m``).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.026814, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.027138, "o", "+   The FAO‑56 model expects wind speed at 2 m above the ground. The conversion uses the logarithmic wind profile\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.027161, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.027233, "o", "+   (FAO‑56 Eq. 47):\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.027256, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.027278, "o", "> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.0273, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.027429, "o", "+   ``u2 = u * (4.87 / log(67.8 * z - 5.42))``\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.027452, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.027474, "o", "+\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.027496, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.02773, "o", "+   where ``u`` is the measured wind speed and ``z`` is the anemometer height in metres.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.027751, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.027773, "o", "> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.027794, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.028147, "o", "+2. **Solar radiation** – raw radiation can be in MJ m⁻² day⁻¹ (already suitable) or in W m⁻². When the unit is\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.028169, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.02819, "o", "> "]
[103.028482, "o", "+   ``W/m2`` we convert to MJ m⁻² day⁻¹ using ``MJ = W * 86400 / 1e6`` (seconds per day, 10⁶ J per MJ).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.028504, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.028528, "o", "> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.02855, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.028798, "o", "+These conversions are applied after the raw CSV is read and before the DataFrame is returned.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.028828, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.028852, "o", "+\"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.028875, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.028896, "o", "+\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.028918, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.028943, "o", "+import os\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.028986, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.029042, "o", "+import numpy as np\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.029064, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.029134, "o", "+import pandas as pd\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.029164, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.029186, "o", "> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.029207, "o", "> "]
[103.029262, "o", "+from . import fao56\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.029281, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.029306, "o", "> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.029328, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.029507, "o", "+BASE_COLUMNS = [\"date\", \"tmax_c\", \"tmin_c\", \"wind_ms\", \"solar_rad\"]\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.029528, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.029549, "o", "> "]
[103.029756, "o", "+HUMIDITY_COLUMNS = {\"rh_minmax\": [\"rh_max_pct\", \"rh_min_pct\"], \"dewpoint\": [\"tdew_c\"]}\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.029788, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.029809, "o", "+\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.02983, "o", "> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.029851, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.029941, "o", "+def _wind_to_2m(wind, height_m):\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.029969, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.029992, "o", "> "]
[103.030198, "o", "+    \"\"\"Convert wind speed measured at ``height_m`` to the standard 2 m height.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.030221, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.030244, "o", "> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.030268, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.030509, "o", "+    Implements FAO‑56 Eq. 47. ``wind`` and ``height_m`` may be scalars or NumPy arrays.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.03053, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.030553, "o", "> "]
[103.030575, "o", "+    \"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.030597, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.030695, "o", "+    wind = np.asarray(wind, float)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.030718, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.030741, "o", "> "]
[103.030838, "o", "+    height = np.asarray(height_m, float)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.03086, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.030882, "o", "> "]
[103.031015, "o", "+    factor = 4.87 / np.log(67.8 * height - 5.42)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.031036, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.031062, "o", "> "]
[103.031118, "o", "+    return wind * factor\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.03114, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.031162, "o", "> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.031184, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.031206, "o", "+\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.031227, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.031324, "o", "+def _convert_radiation(rs, units):\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.031347, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.031368, "o", "> "]
[103.031515, "o", "+    \"\"\"Convert solar radiation to MJ m⁻² day⁻¹.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.031551, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> +\r\n"]
[103.031573, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.031596, "o", "> "]
[103.031809, "o", "+    ``units`` is the string from the station register (e.g. \"MJ/m2/day\" or \"W/m2\").\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.031829, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.031854, "o", "> "]
[103.032088, "o", "+    If the units contain the letter \"w\" we assume Watts per square metre and convert using\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.032109, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.032134, "o", "> "]
[103.032382, "o", "+    ``MJ = W * 86400 / 1e6``. Otherwise the value is returned unchanged (assumed to already be MJ).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.032403, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.032426, "o", "> "]
[103.032448, "o", "+    \"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.03247, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.032492, "o", "> "]
[103.032566, "o", "+    rs = np.asarray(rs, float)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.032587, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.032615, "o", "> "]
[103.03267, "o", "+    low = units.lower()\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.032693, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.032715, "o", "> "]
[103.032766, "o", "+    if \"w\" in low:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.032788, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.032809, "o", "> "]
[103.032895, "o", "+        return rs * 86400.0 / 1e6\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.032916, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.032938, "o", "> "]
[103.03298, "o", "+    return rs\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.033002, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.033025, "o", "> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.033049, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.033071, "o", "+\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.033093, "o", "> "]
[103.033188, "o", "+def load_station(station, data_dir):\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.033209, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.033233, "o", "> "]
[103.033517, "o", "+    \"\"\"Return a DataFrame with columns ``station_id, date, doy, tmax, tmin, ea, u2, rs`` (standard units).\"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.033544, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.033567, "o", "> "]
[103.033723, "o", "+    path = os.path.join(data_dir, f\"{station.station_id}.csv\")\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.033743, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.03377, "o", "> "]
[103.033834, "o", "+    raw = pd.read_csv(path)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.033854, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.033877, "o", "> "]
[103.034009, "o", "+    if station.humidity not in HUMIDITY_COLUMNS:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.034029, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.034055, "o", "> "]
[103.034287, "o", "+        raise ValueError(f\"{station.station_id}: unknown humidity type {station.humidity!r}\")\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.034309, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.034331, "o", "> "]
[103.034586, "o", "+    missing = [c for c in BASE_COLUMNS + HUMIDITY_COLUMNS[station.humidity] if c not in raw.columns]\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.034608, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.034631, "o", "> "]
[103.034669, "o", "+    if missing:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.034697, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.034869, "o", "+        raise ValueError(f\"{path}: missing columns {missing}\")\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.034889, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.034912, "o", "> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.034934, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.035111, "o", "+    dates = pd.to_datetime(raw[\"date\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.035125, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.035167, "o", "> "]
[103.035214, "o", "+    df = pd.DataFrame({\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.035237, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.035259, "o", "> "]
[103.035363, "o", "+        \"station_id\": station.station_id,\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.035376, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.035404, "o", "> "]
[103.035521, "o", "+        \"date\": dates.dt.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\"),\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.035544, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.035566, "o", "> "]
[103.035684, "o", "+        \"doy\": dates.dt.dayofyear.astype(int),\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.035704, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.035728, "o", "> "]
[103.03584, "o", "+        \"tmax\": raw[\"tmax_c\"].astype(float),\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.035859, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.035881, "o", "> "]
[103.036002, "o", "+        \"tmin\": raw[\"tmin_c\"].astype(float),\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.036023, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.036045, "o", "> "]
[103.036067, "o", "+    })\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.036089, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.03611, "o", "+\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.036133, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.036205, "o", "+    # Vapour pressure (ea)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.036227, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.036249, "o", "> "]
[103.036347, "o", "+    if station.humidity == \"dewpoint\":\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.036371, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.036392, "o", "> "]
[103.036606, "o", "+        df[\"ea\"] = fao56.actual_vapour_pressure_dewpoint(raw[\"tdew_c\"].astype(float))\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.036625, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.03665, "o", "> "]
[103.036672, "o", "+    else:\r\n"]
[103.036694, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.036716, "o", "> "]
[103.036846, "o", "+        df[\"ea\"] = fao56.actual_vapour_pressure_rh(\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.036868, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.036889, "o", "> "]
[103.03715, "o", "+            df[\"tmax\"], df[\"tmin\"], raw[\"rh_max_pct\"].astype(float), raw[\"rh_min_pct\"].astype(float)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.037169, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.037194, "o", "> "]
[103.03722, "o", "+        )\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.037242, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.037264, "o", "> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.037285, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.037408, "o", "+    # Wind speed conversion to 2 m height\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.037427, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.037453, "o", "> "]
[103.037652, "o", "+    df[\"u2\"] = _wind_to_2m(raw[\"wind_ms\"].astype(float), station.wind_height_m)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.037673, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.037698, "o", "> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.03772, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.037942, "o", "+    # Solar radiation conversion based on the unit declared in the station register\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.037966, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.037991, "o", "> "]
[103.03823, "o", "+    df[\"rs\"] = _convert_radiation(raw[\"solar_rad\"].astype(float), station.radiation_units)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.038252, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.038274, "o", "> "]
[103.038314, "o", "+    return df\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.038335, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.038358, "o", "> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.03838, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[103.038402, "o", "+EOF\r\n"]
[103.038424, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[103.038446, "o", "> "]
[103.784751, "i", "python -m et0.selfcheck\n"]
[103.784916, "o", "python -m et0.selfcheck\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[103.784941, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
