[290.629131, "o", "> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[290.629427, "o", "+1. **Wind speed** – stations report mean wind speed at the height of their anemometer (``station.wind_height_m``).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[290.629468, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[290.62976, "o", "+   The FAO‑56 model expects wind speed at 2 m above the ground. The conversion uses the logarithmic wind profile\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[290.629798, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[290.629855, "o", "+   (FAO‑56 Eq. 47):\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[290.629896, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[290.629933, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[290.630052, "o", "+   ``u2 = u * (4.87 / log(67.8 * z - 5.42))``\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[290.630092, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> +\r\n"]
[290.630099, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[290.630144, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[290.630152, "o", "> "]
[290.630342, "o", "+   where ``u`` is the measured wind speed and ``z`` is the anemometer height in metres.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[290.630377, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[290.630384, "o", "+\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[290.630437, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[290.630742, "o", "+2. **Solar radiation** – raw radiation can be in MJ m⁻² day⁻¹ (already suitable) or in W m⁻². When the unit is\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[290.630778, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[290.631085, "o", "+   ``W/m2`` we convert to MJ m⁻² day⁻¹ using ``MJ = W * 86400 / 1e6`` (seconds per day, 10⁶ J per MJ).\r\n"]
[290.631123, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
