[317.817054, "o", "> "]
[317.817769, "o", "+1. **Wind speed** – stations report mean wind speed at the height of their anemometer (``station.wind_height_m``).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[317.817811, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[317.817849, "o", "> "]
[317.818597, "o", "+   The FAO‑56 model expects wind speed at 2 m above the ground. The conversion uses the logarithmic wind profile\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[317.818652, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.818831, "o", "+   (FAO‑56 Eq. 47):\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[317.818895, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[317.818934, "o", "> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[317.819006, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[317.819047, "o", "> "]
