[317.820171, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.821012, "o", "+2. **Solar radiation** – raw radiation can be in MJ m⁻² day⁻¹ (already suitable) or in W m⁻². When the unit is\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[317.82107, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[317.821107, "o", "> "]
[317.821852, "o", "+   ``W/m2`` we convert to MJ m⁻² day⁻¹ using ``MJ = W * 86400 / 1e6`` (seconds per day, 10⁶ J per MJ).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[317.821896, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[317.821934, "o", "> "]
[317.821985, "o", "+\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
