[372.228359, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[372.228393, "o", "> "]
[372.229153, "o", "+1. **Wind speed** – stations report mean wind speed at the height of their anemometer (``station.wind_height_m``).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[372.229197, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[372.229232, "o", "> "]
[372.229986, "o", "+   The FAO‑56 model expects wind speed at 2 m above the ground. The conversion uses the logarithmic wind profile\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[372.230033, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[372.230068, "o", "> "]
[372.230222, "o", "+   (FAO‑56 Eq. 47):\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[372.230266, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[372.2303, "o", "> +\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[372.230352, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[372.230386, "o", "> "]
[372.230681, "o", "+   ``u2 = u * (4.87 / log(67.8 * z - 5.42))``\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[372.230722, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[372.230759, "o", "> +\r\n"]
[372.230793, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[372.230828, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[372.231417, "o", "+   where ``u`` is the measured wind speed and ``z`` is the anemometer height in metres.\r\n"]
[372.231453, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[372.231488, "o", "> "]
[372.231523, "o", "+\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[372.231561, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[372.231596, "o", "> "]
[372.232427, "o", "+2. **Solar radiation** – raw radiation can be in MJ m⁻² day⁻¹ (already suitable) or in W m⁻². When the unit is\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[372.232469, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[372.232503, "o", "> "]
[372.233257, "o", "+   ``W/m2`` we convert to MJ m⁻² day⁻¹ using ``MJ = W * 86400 / 1e6`` (seconds per day, 10⁶ J per MJ).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[372.2333, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[372.233334, "o", "> +\r\n"]
[372.233369, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[372.233403, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[372.23404, "o", "+These conversions are applied after the raw CSV is read and before the DataFrame is returned.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
