[372.241342, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[372.241369, "o", "> "]
[372.241946, "o", "+    If the units contain the letter \"w\" we assume Watts per square metre and convert using\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[372.241999, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[372.242021, "o", "> "]
[372.24267, "o", "+    ``MJ = W * 86400 / 1e6``. Otherwise the value is returned unchanged (assumed to already be MJ).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
