[397.988219, "o", "2. **Solar radiation** – raw radiation can be in MJ m⁻² day⁻¹ (already suitable) or in W m⁻². When the unit is\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[397.988332, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[397.989061, "o", "   ``W/m2`` we convert to MJ m⁻² day⁻¹ using ``MJ = W * 86400 / 1e6`` (seconds per day, 10⁶ J per MJ).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
