[429.497959, "o", "> "]
[429.498251, "o", "1. **Wind speed** – stations report mean wind speed at the height of their anemometer (``station.wind_height_m``).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[429.498275, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[429.498296, "o", "> "]
[429.498585, "o", "   The FAO‑56 model expects wind speed at 2 m above the ground. The conversion uses the logarithmic wind profile\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
