[429.499558, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[429.499563, "o", "> "]
[429.499882, "o", "   ``W/m2`` we convert to MJ m⁻² day⁻¹ using ``MJ = W * 86400 / 1e6`` (seconds per day, 10⁶ J per MJ).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[429.499938, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
